{"articleNo":"335754","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=335754&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2021학년도 2학기 학부(과) 강의평가(최종) 실시 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.11.30","hit":"41141","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2021</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학년도 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가를 다음과 같이 실시하오니 학생 여러분의&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">적극적인 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2021. 12. 1.(</span><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">수</span></font></b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 09:00 ~ 12. 24.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 24:00 </span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">참여방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">원스톱서비스 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학사관리 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가서 작성</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">평가내용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">기본문항 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">+ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형별</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">이론</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">실험 실습</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">설계</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">개 유형 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">+ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형별</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">온라인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)*</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">온라인 수업으로 운영 중인 강좌에 한하여 평가 시행</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형별 적용방안 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형이 혼재되어 있는 경우 학점이 높은 순</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">동일학점인 경우 이론</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">실험 실습</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">설계 순으로 적용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">본 강의평가 설문에 대한 </span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">익명성은 철저하게 보장</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">이 되며</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학생이 평가한 결과는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">성적부여에 영향을 미치지 않는 성적 확정 이후에 해당 교수에게 열람 됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></b></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가 기간</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">중에 </span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">평가를 실시하지 않은 학생</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">은 해당 학기 </span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">성적열람기간에&nbsp;</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">성적을 열람할 수 없습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2021. 11.</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt